    "incidence_budget": "For r_G<j, each valid degree-j split locator on G needs at least j-r_G additional intersections with non-forced root hyperplanes.  Each non-forced E_s cuts G in length at most c.  Hence the number of valid Q-classes, and therefore the number of finite slopes represented by this component, is at most floor(c*(512-r_G)/(126-r_G)).",
